error[duplicate-bounds]: @min conflicts with @range on typedef `MyInt`
   ┌ test.idl:5:6
   │
 2 │ @range(min = 0, max = 100) typedef int32 MyInt;
   ·  ^^^^^ conflicting annotation on `MyInt`
 3 │ 
 4 │ struct Foo {
 5 │     @min(10) MyInt value;
   ·      ^^^ @min on member
 6 │ };
   └──
 help: use either @range or @min/@max, not both
